sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant API as API Gateway
  participant IC as Intent + role layer
  participant R as Retriever
  participant L as Gemini SQL generator
  participant S as SQL Safety
  participant DB as Supabase
  participant E as Evidence Store
  U->>FE: Ask a business question
  FE->>API: Question, role, row limit
  API->>IC: Classify intent and load role context
  IC->>R: Retrieve semantic and schema context
  R-->>API: Context bundle
  API->>L: Generate SQL and business narrative
  L-->>API: Candidate SQL
  API->>S: Validate SELECT/WITH only
  S->>DB: Execute limited query
  DB-->>API: Rows
  API->>E: Save SQL, context, models, and evidence
  API-->>FE: SQL, rows, insight, recommendations, evidence
